      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.71,
      "end_seconds": 45.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.74,
      "end_seconds": 63.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 76, pressure 122 over 71, temperature 36.9, oxygen saturation is 99 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.54,
      "end_seconds": 69.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.55,
      "end_seconds": 71.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.42,
      "end_seconds": 74.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.69,
      "end_seconds": 92.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "There is a dark, six-millimetre mole with an irregular border and two shades of brown on the upper back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.8,
      "end_seconds": 95.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.48,
      "end_seconds": 102.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.65,
      "end_seconds": 116.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any family history of melanoma, lumps in the armpit or pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.23,
      "end_seconds": 126.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "no family history of melanoma, lumps in the armpit or pain, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.89,
      "end_seconds": 130.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.5,
      "end_seconds": 134.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Actually, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.87,
      "end_seconds": 138.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.09,
      "end_seconds": 140.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.14,
      "end_seconds": 143.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.25,
      "end_seconds": 146.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.1,
      "end_seconds": 151.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.16,
      "end_seconds": 166.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.97,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.62,
      "end_seconds": 179.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.33,
      "end_seconds": 183.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.34,
      "end_seconds": 198.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.97,
      "end_seconds": 200.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.8,
      "end_seconds": 216.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.01,
      "end_seconds": 223.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.9,
      "end_seconds": 234.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I think we're dealing with a pigmented lesion that needs removal for a proper diagnosis at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.4,
      "end_seconds": 239.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.38,
      "end_seconds": 266.98,
      "duration_seconds": 26.6,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a pigmented lesion that needs removal for a proper diagnosis, and we'll know more once the a skin biopsy is back. Let's book a skin biopsy to look into changing mole. We should do a dermoscopy for changing mole. Cover up and use factor 50 sunscreen on exposed skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.19,
      "end_seconds": 286.75,
      "duration_seconds": 18.56,
      "text": "Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Please come and see me after the biopsy results. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.17,
      "end_seconds": 294.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "So, I come back after the biopsy results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.69,
      "end_seconds": 300.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.69,
      "end_seconds": 305.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "uh, thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
